01:07:34,736 --> 01:07:40,736
Non-Stop is a 2014  action thriller film directed by Jaume Collet-Serra,
co-produced by Joel Silver, and starring Liam Neeson and Julianne Moore.

13
01:13:12,631 --> 01:13:18,631
It follows an alcoholic ex-NYPD officer turned Federal Air Marshal who must find the killer on an international flight from New York
to London after receiving texts saying someone on board will die every 20 minutes until financial demands are met.

14
01:18:50,526 --> 01:18:56,526
The film marks the second collaboration between
Collet-Serra and Neeson after Unknown (2011).

15
01:24:28,421 --> 01:24:34,421
An international co-production among France, the United States, the United Kingdom and Canada, it was the first and only film
from Silver Pictures to be distributed by Universal Pictures since the end of Silver's deal with Warner Bros.

16
01:30:06,315 --> 01:30:12,315
Released in the United States on February 28, 2014, the film received generally mixed reviews
from critics but was a box office success, grossing $222 million worldwide.

17
01:35:44,210 --> 01:35:50,210
The film explores themes of airplane, bomb, fight, hijacking, murder.

